<p>Hey <%= @resource.first_name_or_fallback %>,</p>

<p>
  Someone asked to reset the password for your Dabble Me account
  (<%= @resource.email %>). Your password will not change until you open the
  link below and create a new one.
</p>

<p><%= link_to 'Change my password', edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %></p>

<p>If this wasn't you, you can ignore this email.</p>

<p>
  <br>
  Thanks,
  <br>
  Dabble Me
</p>
